  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><ol list=\"u5796fa01\"><li fid=\"u01f6f497\" data-lake-id=\"u7b47cbc0\" id=\"u7b47cbc0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u20e2a87b\" id=\"u20e2a87b\" data-comment-id=\"32144930\">编写一个函数，接受一个整数作为参数，判断它是否为偶数，如果是偶数返回1 ，否则返回0</span></li><li fid=\"u01f6f497\" data-lake-id=\"ud13750fa\" id=\"ud13750fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27c366a3\" id=\"u27c366a3\" data-comment-id=\"32074981\">编写一个函数，接受2个int参数作为参数，计算第一个参数~第二个参数范围的累加和(包含首位元素)，并返回累加的结果</span></li><li fid=\"u01f6f497\" data-lake-id=\"udc26b023\" id=\"udc26b023\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ec234ef\" id=\"u7ec234ef\">编写一个函数，接受一个整数作为参数，计算并返回它的阶乘值</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u024c4be6\" id=\"u024c4be6\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0c6ca186\" id=\"u0c6ca186\">5阶乘值：5*4*3*2*1</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u19dc207c\" id=\"u19dc207c\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07562c2a\" id=\"u07562c2a\">n阶乘值：n*(n-1)*(n-2)……2*1</span></p><ol list=\"uc15020e6\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u840776cd\" data-lake-id=\"ue867c81f\" id=\"ue867c81f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u37d6a043\" id=\"u37d6a043\" data-comment-id=\"32075279\">编写一个程序，定义一个整型变量和一个指向该变量的指针，并将指针指向变量，通过2种方式打印整型变量的内容</span></li><li fid=\"u840776cd\" data-lake-id=\"uc093f8fa\" id=\"uc093f8fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda802672\" id=\"uda802672\" data-comment-id=\"32075280 32103104\">编写一个程序，定义一个整型变量，初始值为100，通过某个函数修改改变量的内容为123</span></li><li fid=\"u840776cd\" data-lake-id=\"u38e193c2\" id=\"u38e193c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2ac94eac\" id=\"u2ac94eac\">代码分析题</span></li></ol><ul list=\"ue57cdd8d\"><li fid=\"u7044e2a4\" data-lake-id=\"u1ca32af9\" id=\"u1ca32af9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4c177896\" id=\"u4c177896\">下面的代码中，出现了野指针的情况，请指出并修复错误</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20*ptr%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20*ptr%20%3D%20num%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22Value%3A%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20*ptr)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gsii4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" data-comment-id=\"32074979 34663922 40275343\"></card>",
